  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix-safety release. Every rule whose code fix inserts an await now withholds that fix where the await would not compile — a lock body, an exception filter, an unsafe context, most query clauses, or across a ref-like lifetime such as a live Span<T> — and reports the diagnostic without one. CC013, CC015, CC022, CC025, and CC026 previously offered rewrites that turned compiling code into a build error in those positions; CC028 gained the ref-like half. The findings are unchanged: only the automated rewrite is withheld, because resolving it means restructuring the surrounding code. 30 diagnostics.",
